  "instructions": [
    "In a large saucepan, heat the oil over medium heat.",
    "Sauté the onion, garlic, and ginger until the onion turns translucent.",
    "Add the diced tomato and red chili, and cook for 3-4 minutes.",
    "Mix in the cumin, coriander, turmeric, and salt.",
    "Stir in the chickpea flour and cook for 1-2 minutes.",
    "Gradually add the pasta water, and whisk continuously to avoid lumps.",
    "Continue cooking and whisking for 5-7 minutes, until the dhal thickens to desired consistency.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as necessary.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh herbs or a dollop of yogurt if desired."
  ],
